+++ b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7228.bugfix
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Fix a crash when an invalid regular expression is provided for an option with a
+``regexp``, ``regexp_csv`` or ``regexp_paths_csv`` type: a clean error message
+is now emitted instead of a traceback.
+
+Closes #7228
